{"title":"建造者模式","uid":"b00cac0eae3b04411014ea36945005af","slug":"建造者模式","date":"2023-05-21T11:27:34.000Z","updated":"2023-05-26T13:03:06.588Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/建造者模式.json","keywords":null,"cover":null,"content":"<h1 id=\"建造者模式\"><a href=\"#建造者模式\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"建造者模式\"></a>建造者模式</h1><p>建造者模式（Builder Pattern）是一种创建型设计模式，用于将复杂对象的构建过程与其表示分离。它允许你可以逐步构建一个对象，同时保持构建过程的灵活性。</p>\n<p>该模式的核心思想是将对象的构建过程分解为一系列步骤，每个步骤都有一个对应的建造者（Builder）负责完成。最终，所有的建造者合作完成对象的构建。这样，你就可以通过调用一系列步骤来创建对象，而无需直接操作复杂对象的构建过程。</p>\n<p>建造者模式通常包含以下几个角色：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>产品（Product）：表示最终构建的复杂对象。</li>\n<li>抽象建造者（Builder）：定义了构建产品所需的各个步骤和方法。</li>\n<li>具体建造者（Concrete Builder）：实现了抽象建造者接口，负责具体的构建过程和细节。</li>\n<li>指挥者（Director）：负责指导建造者的构建过程，按特定顺序调用建造者的方法，最终构建出产品。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>通过使用建造者模式，你可以灵活地控制产品的构建过程，并且可以根据不同的需求使用不同的建造者，构建出不同的产品。此外，建造者模式还可以隐藏产品的构建细节，使客户端与具体的构建过程解耦。</p>\n<p>总之，建造者模式提供了一种创建复杂对象的灵活方式，可以将复杂对象的构建过程分解为一系列简单的步骤，并且可以通过不同的步骤组合构建出不同的对象。</p>\n<h2 id=\"构建过程不同\"><a href=\"#构建过程不同\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"构建过程不同\"></a>构建过程不同</h2><p>在建造者模式中，通常存在两种不同的变体：标准建造者模式（Standard Builder Pattern）和流式建造者模式（Fluent Builder Pattern）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"标准建造者模式（Standard-Builder-Pattern）\"><a href=\"#标准建造者模式（Standard-Builder-Pattern）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"标准建造者模式（Standard Builder Pattern）\"></a>标准建造者模式（Standard Builder Pattern）</h3><p>在标准建造者模式中，构建过程是通过一系列方法调用来完成的。每个方法用于设置产品的一个属性，并返回建造者对象本身，以便支持链式调用。这种模式通过逐步构建对象，将复杂对象的构建过程与表示分离。示例如下</p>\n<pre class=\"line-numbers language-python\" data-language=\"python\"><code class=\"language-python\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Car</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>make <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">None</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>model <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">None</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>year <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">None</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__str__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"Car: Make=</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&#123;</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>make<span class=\"token punctuation\">&#125;</span></span><span class=\"token string\">, Model=</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&#123;</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>model<span class=\"token punctuation\">&#125;</span></span><span class=\"token string\">, Year=</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&#123;</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>year<span class=\"token punctuation\">&#125;</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span>\n\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">CarBuilder</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>car <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> Car<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">set_make</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> make<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>car<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>make <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> make\n\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">set_model</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> model<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>car<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>model <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> model\n\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">set_year</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> year<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>car<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>year <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> year\n\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">get_car</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>car\n\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 使用示例</span>\nbuilder <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> CarBuilder<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nbuilder<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>set_make<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"Toyota\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nbuilder<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>set_model<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"Camry\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nbuilder<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>set_year<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token number\">2022</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\ncar <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> builder<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get_car<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">print</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>car<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 输出: Car: Make=Toyota, Model=Camry, Year=2022</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"流式建造者模式（Fluent-Builder-Pattern）\"><a href=\"#流式建造者模式（Fluent-Builder-Pattern）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"流式建造者模式（Fluent Builder Pattern）\"></a>流式建造者模式（Fluent Builder Pattern）</h3><p>流式建造者模式是标准建造者模式的一种扩展，它通过使用方法链（Method Chaining）来实现更流畅的构建过程。在流式建造者模式中，每个设置属性的方法不仅设置属性值，还返回建造者对象本身，以便可以直接调用下一个方法，形成链式调用的语法。</p>\n<pre class=\"line-numbers language-python\" data-language=\"python\"><code class=\"language-python\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Car</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>make <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">None</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>model <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">None</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>year <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">None</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__str__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"Car: Make=</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&#123;</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>make<span class=\"token punctuation\">&#125;</span></span><span class=\"token string\">, Model=</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&#123;</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>model<span class=\"token punctuation\">&#125;</span></span><span class=\"token string\">, Year=</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&#123;</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>year<span class=\"token punctuation\">&#125;</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span>\n\n    \n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">CarBuilder</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>car <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> Car<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">set_make</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> make<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>car<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>make <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> make\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> self  <span class=\"token comment\"># 返回建造者对象本身，支持链式调用</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">set_model</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> model<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>car<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>model <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> model\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> self\n\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">set_year</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> year<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>car<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>year <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> year\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> self\n\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">get_car</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>car\n\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 使用示例</span>\ncar <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> CarBuilder<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>set_make<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"Toyota\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>set_model<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"Camry\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>set_year<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token number\">2022</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get_car<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">print</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>car<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 输出: Car: Make=Toyota, Model=Camry, Year=2022</span>\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre>\n\n<p>以上两个例子是比较简单的建造者模式，没有抽象类以及指挥者类。</p>\n<h2 id=\"抽象建造者模式\"><a href=\"#抽象建造者模式\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"抽象建造者模式\"></a>抽象建造者模式</h2><ol>\n<li>抽象建造者类（Abstract Builder）：<ul>\n<li>定义了构建产品的抽象方法。</li>\n<li>建造者类通常包含一系列抽象方法，用于设置产品的不同部分。</li>\n<li>它提供了一种统一的接口，以便具体建造者类可以实现这些方法来构建具体的产品。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>指挥者类（Director）：<ul>\n<li>负责协调具体建造者类的构建过程。</li>\n<li>它定义了构建的顺序和逻辑，并且控制建造者的调用。</li>\n<li>指挥者类不直接构建产品，而是通过调用具体建造者类的方法来构建产品。</li>\n<li>它根据特定的构建逻辑来调用建造者类的方法，确保产品对象按照预期的方式进行构建。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>抽象建造者类和指挥者类是建造者模式的核心组成部分。抽象建造者类定义了产品构建的接口，而具体建造者类实现了具体的构建过程。指挥者类根据需要使用特定的建造者来构建产品，以确保产品的正确构建顺序和逻辑。这种分离构建逻辑和产品表示的设计使得建造者模式具有灵活性和可扩展性，并且能够轻松地构建不同类型的复杂对象。</p>\n<p>具体的例子可以举得是，比如我们可以设置一个抽象的建造者Abstract_Model类，里面会有很多的参数backbone，classifier等，然后再创建不同的ConcreteAModel,ConcreteBModel去继承这个抽象类之后实现里面的各种组件，最后再使用director类去决定使用里面的哪些参数按照什么样的顺序来进行模型的构建。具体代码可以自己打，我后续补上。</p>\n","feature":true,"text":"建造者模式建造者模式（Builder Pattern）是一种创建型设计模式，用于将复杂对象的构建过程与其表示分离。它允许你可以逐步构建一个对象，同时保持构建过程的灵活性。 该模式的核心思想是将对象的构建过程分解为一系列步骤，每个步骤都有一个对应的建造者（Builder）负责完成。...","link":"","photos":[],"count_time":{"symbolsCount":"3.1k","symbolsTime":"3 mins."},"categories":[],"tags":[{"name":"设计模式","slug":"设计模式","count":2,"path":"api/tags/设计模式.json"}],"toc":"<ol class=\"toc\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-1\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E5%BB%BA%E9%80%A0%E8%80%85%E6%A8%A1%E5%BC%8F\"><span class=\"toc-text\">建造者模式</span></a><ol class=\"toc-child\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-2\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E6%9E%84%E5%BB%BA%E8%BF%87%E7%A8%8B%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C\"><span class=\"toc-text\">构建过程不同</span></a><ol class=\"toc-child\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%E5%BB%BA%E9%80%A0%E8%80%85%E6%A8%A1%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%88Standard-Builder-Pattern%EF%BC%89\"><span class=\"toc-text\">标准建造者模式（Standard Builder Pattern）</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E6%B5%81%E5%BC%8F%E5%BB%BA%E9%80%A0%E8%80%85%E6%A8%A1%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%88Fluent-Builder-Pattern%EF%BC%89\"><span class=\"toc-text\">流式建造者模式（Fluent Builder Pattern）</span></a></li></ol></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-2\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E6%8A%BD%E8%B1%A1%E5%BB%BA%E9%80%A0%E8%80%85%E6%A8%A1%E5%BC%8F\"><span class=\"toc-text\">抽象建造者模式</span></a></li></ol></li></ol>","author":{"name":"弈梒","slug":"blog-author","avatar":"https://s2.loli.net/2023/05/26/pyP4x2KMUameXLD.jpg","link":"/","description":"码粘百遍，其义自见","socials":{"github":"","twitter":"","stackoverflow":"","wechat":"","qq":"","weibo":"","zhihu":"","csdn":"","juejin":"","customs":{}}},"mapped":true,"prev_post":{},"next_post":{"title":"工厂模式学习","uid":"7897b3681b57eabb4fa728c873d77f49","slug":"工厂模式学习","date":"2023-05-21T02:49:36.000Z","updated":"2023-05-21T13:13:02.916Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/工厂模式学习.json","keywords":null,"cover":"https://s2.loli.net/2023/05/21/qBW3RVIMYgZdkfP.jpg","text":"前言最近的项目正在搭建框架，本科的时候做大创写代码都没有考虑到设计模式的问题，代码一多起来了，改动和拓展的成本就很大，也不方便理解整个项目的逻辑。因为我自己没有用过什么设计模式，对于我目前要做的项目要用什么样的设计模式我没法自己构思。但是我看过不少类似我现在项目的项目如果使用了设...","link":"","photos":[],"count_time":{"symbolsCount":"6.4k","symbolsTime":"6 mins."},"categories":[],"tags":[{"name":"设计模式","slug":"设计模式","count":2,"path":"api/tags/设计模式.json"}],"author":{"name":"弈梒","slug":"blog-author","avatar":"https://s2.loli.net/2023/05/26/pyP4x2KMUameXLD.jpg","link":"/","description":"码粘百遍，其义自见","socials":{"github":"","twitter":"","stackoverflow":"","wechat":"","qq":"","weibo":"","zhihu":"","csdn":"","juejin":"","customs":{}}},"feature":true}}